371
00:28:04,172 --> 00:28:09,672
and we really, really, just really wanted to start
creating our own Daily Diary together with you all!

372
00:28:10,172 --> 00:28:13,172
And also, listening to it over and over,
we kept on imagining...

373
00:28:13,172 --> 00:28:16,672
...what that might look like!

374
00:28:17,672 --> 00:28:22,172
そう、ふわもこにとって でいりぃだいありぃはすごく大切な曲で
Yes, Daily Diary is an extremely important song for Fuwamoko,

375
00:28:22,172 --> 00:28:25,172
