and we listened to it a lot before our debut.

376
00:28:25,172 --> 00:28:29,172
あの頃の気持ちは今でもすごく覚えてて
Even now, we still clearly remember how we felt back then.

377
00:28:29,172 --> 00:28:34,672
早くデビューしてみんなとの でいりぃだいありぃが
作りたくて作りたくて、しょうがなかったんですね
We wanted to debut as soon as possible and start
making our Daily Diary with everyone so badly!

378
00:28:34,672 --> 00:28:39,672
