531
00:40:28,235 --> 00:40:32,635
at the top of our lungs to the numbness, this city never died

532
00:40:34,735 --> 00:40:37,635
what was the root of it all? I couldn't say

533
00:40:37,635 --> 00:40:40,135
used to jump and then fall, rugged and clichéd

534
00:40:40,135 --> 00:40:42,735
would shrug it off without complaint, not a sound

535
