it's when you shoved yourself into a crowded place

537
00:40:48,235 --> 00:40:51,035
that you turned around and found yourself in love in outer space

538
00:40:51,035 --> 00:40:55,935
cue the reckless nights, no strings, laughing at our own dreams, just what the hell was so funny?

539
00:40:55,935 --> 00:40:58,435
bark up the wrong tree, stumble, used to falling great heights

540
