what is there to miss?

576
00:42:43,935 --> 00:42:46,735
fade in, fade out

577
00:42:46,735 --> 00:42:49,635
this hazy dream

578
00:42:49,635 --> 00:42:54,535
without a direction, roaming aimlessly

579
