pretend it's the end of a made-up story

581
00:43:04,435 --> 00:43:08,735
I'll fly, no proof

582
00:43:08,735 --> 00:43:14,835
those heights, I'll never find another chance to say "hey, thanks for saving my life"

583
00:43:14,835 --> 00:43:17,035
I was hopeless, it was stinging

584
00:43:17,035 --> 00:43:19,635
driving roadless, we were singing

585
00:43:19,635 --> 00:43:23,935
at the top of our lungs to the numbness, this city never died

